-- Challenge registry. Each entry has:
--   id        — unique numeric ID string (matches GMNotes on tokens)
--   name      — display name of the challenge
--   modPrefix — prefix buzzword: "Skip"/"Added"/"Force"/"MixUp"/"Blocked" (colored+italic, followed by ":").
--               "None" = explicitly not displayed. nil = not displayed.
--   modLabel  — free text after the prefix (shown in gold). nil = prefix-only display.
--   stackFn   — optional function(count) returning the stacked modLabel when count > 1
--   applyTiming — when the challenge's effect is applied (see getChallengeTiming):
--                 "gameStart"  (default) — once at round 1.
--                 "roundStart" — re-applied at the start of every round (via roundSetup).
--                 "instant"    — applied the moment the token enters/leaves the challenge
--                                zone, even during setup or mid-game (applyInstantChallengeChange).
